摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"接入 Google Anti Gravity Coding Plan 作为 DeepSeek Harness LLM Provider，直接使用账号下的 Gemini / Claude / GPT-OSS。 | Google Anti Gravity Coding Plan LLM Provider for DeepSeek Harness.","id":"gh:1334361961","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-antigravity","slug":"OpenSaozi/dsh-antigravity","topics":["claude","cloud-code-assist","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","gemini","google-antigravity","llm","llm-provider","oauth2","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"接入 Google Anti Gravity Coding Plan 作为 DeepSeek Harness LLM Provider，直接使用账号下的 Gemini / Claude / GPT-O"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"SS。 | Google Anti Gravity Coding Plan LLM Provider for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Plugin: LLM Provider - Anti Gravity"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Allows connecting to the **Google Anti Gravity** Coding Plan as an LLM Provider, enabling DeepSeek H"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"arness to directly use all top-tier AI models under your account (including Gemini 3.7/3.6/3.5 Flash"},{"id":"p4s3","text":", Gemini 3.1 Pro, Claude 3.7 / Opus 4.6, GPT-OSS, etc.) for seamless web-based chat and coding."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Target Audience and Use Cases"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Designed for developers with Google Anti Gravity IDE installed or active Cloud Code Assist entitleme"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"nts who want to access these high-performance models within the unified DeepSeek Harness workspace f"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"or coding, reasoning, and tool execution."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Key Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **Lightweight Native Direct Connection**: Directly connects over HTTPS to Cloud Code Assist withou"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"t spawning background `agy` subprocesses or IDE instances.\n- **One-Click macOS Authorization**: Auto"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"matically validates and imports signed macOS Anti Gravity client configurations, opening the standar"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"d browser OAuth flow without manual Client ID/Secret copying.\n- **Dynamic Model Discovery**: Queries"},{"id":"p8s5","text":" the live `fetchAvailableModels` endpoint to surface reviewed Gemini, Claude, and GPT-OSS model vari"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"ants.\n- **Independent Provider Route**: The plugin registers its own `google-antigravity` adapter, o"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"wns its catalog, and resolves OAuth. It reuses the exported `PiAiAdapter` only for Harness message a"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"nd stream conversion.\n- **Built-in Login Page**: A package-owned Typert Remote provides login start,"},{"id":"p8s9","text":" status polling, and logout; the browser half registers a dedicated Anti Gravity settings page.\n- **"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"Clean Native Experience**: Preserves thinking signatures, streaming output, and tool invocation cont"},{"id":"p8s11","text":"racts without injected provider system prompts, synthetic messages, or custom headers."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Installation and Quick Start"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Install a reviewed revision into a DeepSeek Harness profile. The repository provides a `dsh.bundle` "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"patch and prebuilt runtime artifacts so no local build steps are required:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The installed bundle contributes the following Cordis configuration:"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Both `oauthCredentialEnv` and `oauthClientConfigRef` name credential references. The bundled local p"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"rovider stores documents in `$DSH_HOME/.credentials.yaml`; deployments may use another credential ba"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"r stores documents in `$DSH_HOME/.credentials.yaml`; deployments may use another credential backend."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Security and Credentials"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- The plugin uses two credential references: `GOOGLE_ANTIGRAVITY_OAUTH_CLIENT_CONFIG` for private OA"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"uth application details and `GOOGLE_ANTIGRAVITY_OAUTH_CREDENTIAL` for user tokens.\n- Credentials rem"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"ain inside the Harness host credential service and never leak into settings, model catalogs, logs, o"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"r frontend responses.\n- For inference, the plugin calls the OAuth handler's `toAuth()` and passes th"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"e resulting JSON auth value to pi-ai as a per-request override; pi-ai's model collection holds no Cr"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"ON auth value to pi-ai as a per-request override; pi-ai's model collection holds no CredentialStore."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Issues and scoped pull requests are welcome. Please describe observed provider responses, omit secre"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ts and account identifiers, update both README languages, and run package tests in a matching DeepSe"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"ek Harness workspace."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## License and Disclaimer"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"MIT License. This independent integration is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google, DeepMind, De"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"epSeek, or pi-ai maintainers. Google Anti Gravity and related model names are trademarks of their re"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" maintainers. Google Anti Gravity and related model names are trademarks of their respective owners."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Model Experience"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### Anti Gravity Inference"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"#### What the model sees"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The selected model receives the Harness system prompt as `systemInstruction`, along with normalized "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"conversation messages and tool definitions. The plugin adds no vendor prompts or instructions. The t"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ransport retains native Cloud Code Assist envelopes: sending authorized JSON/SSE headers and officia"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"l fields (`project`, `model`, `request`, `requestType`, `userAgent`, and `requestId`) without compat"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"ibility headers, identity messages, or synthetic turns."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"#### Token effect"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"No additional model-visible tokens are added beyond the system prompt, history, and tools in the req"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"uest. Cloud Code Assist reports prompt, candidate, thinking, and cached token counts; the adapter ma"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ps these fields directly without estimation."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"#### KV Cache effect"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Logical message order is preserved. Thinking signatures and tool call IDs persist across subsequent "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"turns. Upstream cache reuse remains governed by Cloud Code Assist and may reset when earlier turns o"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"cache reuse remains governed by Cloud Code Assist and may reset when earlier turns or models change."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Known Limitations and Deferred Work"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- Google delivers this subscription path over internal `v1internal` Cloud Code Assist endpoints rath"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"er than public Gemini APIs; endpoint changes may affect this plugin independently of public Gemini s"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ervices.\n- OAuth starts from the plugin-owned Anti Gravity settings page, and the account must hold "},{"id":"p30s4","text":"active service entitlements.\n- Automatic OAuth client import currently supports Google-signed macOS "},{"id":"p30s5","text":"`Antigravity IDE.app` installations. Non-standard paths can be supplied via `macosApplicationPath`; "},{"id":"p30s6","text":"other operating systems require credentials pre-provisioned via the credentials service.\n- Catalog i"},{"id":"p30s7","text":"tems describe provider capabilities and do not guarantee remaining quota. Depleted quotas return as "},{"id":"p30s8","text":"provider errors during inference."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
